{"id":2954,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;六月风暖，逐光而行。2026年6月11日下午四点半，信息与通信工程学院2026年度陈国强“励志成才”助学金颁奖仪式在温情中拉开帷幕。信息与通信工程学院院长王黎明、信息与通信工程学院党委副书记兼副院长么兰出席活动。校友陈林先生因工作原因无法亲临，特委托其班主任——学生工作部副部长魏媛媛老师代为到场。师生齐聚，共赴一场善意之约。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=yLN7hZLmCYM47ZL3z-DM4GiUNLYLRNBZLmv8MlWknl74L4-0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPokyaMky4LNLsozGbMRl4L4-snmVVLz-bL874MlU4UlMFolLaoRfRMzMFM7rfLN-Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLmvbgtA8pUGcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4180432C7909453327F1E1293A35D3AC/9C080C53/4EA2B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=yLN7hZLmCYM47ZL3z-DM4GiUNLYLRNBZLmv8MlWknl74L4-0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPokyaMky4LNLsozGbMRl4L4-snmVVLz-bL874MlU4UlMFolLaoRfRMzMFM7rfLN-Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLmvbgtA8pUGcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.jpg\"></p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 仪式伊始，王黎明院长深情致辞。他高度赞扬同学们勤学善思、自立自强的精神品质，并勉励大家将关爱化为前行的动力，脚踏实地、奋勇争先，努力成长为有理想、有本领、有担当的新时代青年。随后，么兰老师宣读获奖名单。在热烈的掌声中，获奖学生依次上台，王黎明院长与魏媛媛副部长共同为同学们颁发捐赠牌匾。牌匾虽轻，却承载着校友的爱心与学院的殷切期望，为逐梦之路撑起一片晴空。<br></p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;颁奖结束后，获奖学生代表翟洪走上讲台分享感悟。她从潜心钻研专业课，到投身学科竞赛；从坚守党员初心，到追逐人生理想——用一步一个脚印诠释了“励志”的真意，道出了全体受助同学的心声：感谢校友的托举，更承诺未来去托举别人。真挚的发言，令在场师生深受触动。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=yL7Lh4o7-in7MfM38MfLzN8UNU4Ll7BaM4L8U8-DnmQ2nN-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh2M1ysLSyYollsM7MRLm7bLl-ZMmQVUzlbMmUYMNMkLRVFMzNiU4lbMNQFoRW7M4UJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLmvbgtA8pUGcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DF67129E74CC2191B866EA596426CB01/595C596F/82D74\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ynlUhDUmf7oRC4L37n2nRvDnRfVM8VB2Mm7DLz6RnlLiLzC0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRoSy4LSyZo77aLRGDnzW2MlL8UmLsLNVkM4nVLmlYUNnFU4lso7r2UmTFLzvsn7UsgjfJQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPoR-soSbw62G8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.png\"></p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 掌声落定，现场播放了校友陈林先生特意录制的寄语视频。这份爱心背后，是陈林先生的拳拳心意。他以父亲陈国强之名设立助学金，既寄托着对母校的深厚情谊，也饱含着对学弟学妹的殷殷期许。视频中，这位从农村走出的校友坦言自己“深知打拼的不易”，希望通过这份资助，让寒门学子走得顺一些、远一些。朴实的话语，让在场师生无不动容。<br></p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 视频结束后，另一位获奖学生代表张思怡手捧一张亲手写下的感谢卡片，深情朗读：“常怀感恩之心，未来尽己所能传递温暖。”一字一句，发自肺腑，赢得了全场热烈的掌声。</p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 点滴善意，汇聚暖流；励志初心，步履不停。本次颁奖仪式不仅为家庭经济困难的学生缓解了生活压力，更在全院范围内营造出感恩向善、勤学进取的良好氛围。授人以渔，薪火相传。愿全体信通学子带着这份关爱与期许，不负嘱托，笃行不怠，以青春之姿逐梦远航。在收获温暖之后，努力成为微光，将这份爱心与善意一直传递下去。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=yL87hDoR9DM8LaL37CbL4Q2nRLsL7CB8nzlYLlrRMzQ7M490gihFp2hmCIa0U1ybU1yinkhVUN7YU4ffolUio7W7M47sM7-PL8L8MzG4UmVFnRU4nRGbUlVFL8nfLmvJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLmvbgtA8pUGcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B9B5DEBA2C0A9D58BD7174B13C4503B1/D43D09AA/3DA27\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=yUzLhiMzvinzNDn3NnVLznVMzlPnmVBfMl7PMNW2UzvZM770gihFp2hmCIa0M1hRn1y4okyPM4Lso7LbozlZoRNDnNCbnlnfM7V7nzrVLzTFUlCbMm7YnlVFozVRMzUJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLmvbgtA8pUGcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=yLmAhknzQ2MRCbM3RGDnmnVMNlZMRWB7LR78LmMVn7-8nNC0gihFp2hmCIa0oShkoSyPLShRLRL4MlMkMNVfU4liLm9ZLmMVoR9ZozNPLmrFoRA7U8WfLmQFL8lPnN7Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLmvbgtA8pUGcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9B911C0335CB6AAC5528823E88899125/88DCBA26/3E1FA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=yUzlhiU8L4LzLZM3NnRLz7DMmv4Ml-BsLNQ7nz9sM7UYMNL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h7L1y4U1yDL4r7MmG8M4Q7Mz98nzTkoRUPnzvbL4LsMz6FLRf7Mm-ZU46FUz7ZUzLJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLmvbgtA8pUGcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=yLN7hZLmCYM47ZL3z-DM4GiUNLYLRNBZLmv8MlWknl74L4-0gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPokyaMky4LNLsozGbMRl4L4-snmVVLz-bL874MlU4UlMFolLaoRfRMzMFM7rfLN-Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47ZLmvbgtA8pUGcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=18279&e=.jpg"}